    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, fight or flee! In Powder Runners: Maze Quest, you alone or with your team will face dangerous mazes against opponents and traps. Grab weapons to face enemies, collect healing items to survive and make quick decisions: is it worth engaging in combat or is it better to simply run? And get ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match is a battle of strategy, speed and courage. Do you have what it takes to come out on top and achieve glory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or call your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powder Runners: Maze Quest is an action, adventure and strategy game where every second counts! Enter treacherous mazes full of traps and enemies, where the goal is simple: be the first to reach the Magic Portal and Win! But be careful \u2013 other players are also after victory, and they won't make your journey easy!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, fight or flee! In Powder Runners: Maze Quest, you alone or with your team will face dangerous mazes against opponents and traps. Grab weapons to face enemies, collect healing items to survive and make quick decisions: is it worth engaging in combat or is it better to simply run? And get ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match is a battle of strategy, speed and courage. Do you have what it takes to come out on top and achieve glory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or call your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powder Runners: Maze Quest is an action, adventure and strategy game where every second counts! Enter treacherous mazes full of traps and enemies, where the goal is simple: be the first to reach the Magic Portal and Win! But be careful \u2013 other players are also after victory, and they won't make your journey easy!</p>",
    "short_description": "Call your friends and take on this epic challenge, play as a team or alone, to prove that you are the best! But remember: only the fastest will achieve glory. Get ready for chaos, lots of fun and mysteries \u2013 the maze awaits you!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Japanese",
